  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WEATHER_ENGINE": "Weather Engine",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WEATHER_ENGINE_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Allows the Weather Engine ritual (300 [ICON_PRODUCTION], repeatable). Each completion: one weather, cast by a unit in its city, centred on a plot within 10 plots of the city, over the plots within 5 plots of the centre, for the rest of the turn and the next 5.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Blizzard: units there do not heal and start their turns with one move fewer (never below one).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Storm: SHOOT and BOMBARD deal half damage in battles there.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Fog: no SHOOT in the first round of battles there; units there are hidden from other teams with no unit or city within 1 plot of them.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WEATHER_ENGINE_PEDIA": "Brass vanes on a tower of copper, and engineers who read the wind's pressure like a ledger and change it.",
    "TXT_KEY_PROJECT_WEATHER_ENGINE": "Weather Engine",
    "TXT_KEY_PROJECT_WEATHER_ENGINE_STRATEGY": "[ICON_BULLET]Each completion: one weather (Blizzard, Storm or Fog), cast by a unit in this city at a plot within 10 plots of it. It covers the plots within 5 plots of that plot for the rest of the turn and the next 5.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Not while the city holds a weather not yet cast.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WEATHER_BLIZZARD": "Blizzard",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WEATHER_BLIZZARD_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Spends the Weather Engine of the caster's city.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The target: a plot within 10 plots of the city. For the rest of the turn and the next 5, units within 5 plots of it do not heal and start their turns with one move fewer (never below one).",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WEATHER_STORM": "Storm",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WEATHER_STORM_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Spends the Weather Engine of the caster's city.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The target: a plot within 10 plots of the city. For the rest of the turn and the next 5, SHOOT and BOMBARD deal half damage in battles within 5 plots of it.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WEATHER_FOG": "Fog",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WEATHER_FOG_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Spends the Weather Engine of the caster's city.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The target: a plot within 10 plots of the city. For the rest of the turn and the next 5, within 5 plots of it: no SHOOT in the first round of battles, and units are hidden from other teams with no unit or city within 1 plot of them."
  }
}
